@page
@model FineUI.Core.Examples.Pages.Tree.DataBindDocumentCustomAttributesModel
@{
    ViewBag.SourceFiles = "~/wwwroot/content/tree/website.xml";
    ViewBag.Title = "Tree/DataBindDocumentCustomAttributes";
    var F = Html.F();
}

@section head {

    <style>
        .f-tree-node[data-highlight=true] .f-tree-cell-text {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: red;
        }
    </style>

}


@section body {

    <f:Tree ID="Tree1" IsFluid="true" ShowHeader="true" Title="树控件（点击树节点回发）" OnNodeClick="Tree1_NodeClick">
    </f:Tree>

    <f:Label ID="labResult" EncodeText="false"></f:Label>

    <br>
    <br>


}


@section script {


}
@section exampleDescription {
    <section aria-label="页面描述">
        <p>演示手工读取 XML 并创建树节点，同时根据数据设置自定义 HTML 属性。</p>
        <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-list" aria-hidden="true"></i>点击带自定义配置的节点</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>在<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Tree1"
                    title="树控件（点击树节点回发）">树控件（点击树节点回发）</strong>展开中国和省级目录，再点击带特殊样式的节点。<br />结果：节点点击后回发，后台读取节点信息并更新结果标签；带 <code>data</code>-<code>highlight</code>
                属性的节点会额外显示高亮说明。</li>
        </ul>
        <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>补充说明</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>从 <code>XmlDocument</code> 手工创建节点列表，并将 <code>Xml</code> 节点属性 <code>Highlight</code> 转化为树节点的 <code>Attributes</code> 属性。</li>
        </ul>
        <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>关键属性</h3>
        <ul class="example-description-properties">
            <li><code>Nodes</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Tree1" title="树控件（点击树节点回发）">树控件（点击树节点回发）</strong>）：保存本页从 XML
                生成的节点层级。</li>
            <li><code>Attributes</code>（<strong>树节点</strong>，位于<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Tree1"
                    title="树控件（点击树节点回发）">树控件（点击树节点回发）</strong>）：把自定义数据写为节点 HTML 属性，供本页 CSS 和后台读取。</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
}
